tellation ever launched with much  more to come suffice it to say that a  day at the office with elon musk at the  helm could either be a long day of work  or downright revolutionary brian bjeld  vice president of human resources put it  perfectly when he said i truly believe  musk embraces what leadership is and  part of being a leader is working for  your people we are not all here to serve  elon musk and his needs rather he's  there to serve ours it's a breath of  fresh air to have a leader who sincerely  cares it's not about the bottom line or  making a dollar to him it's about the  mission so what do you think it's like  working for elon musk and are you gonna  polish up that resume and finally apply  to work for him if you enjoyed this  video you should click on a video on the  screen it'll be pretty good too see you  there

